  <title>MATH-132B Final Project</title>

  <introduction>
    <p> Throughout the semester, you and your group members will conduct a series of statistical experiments on a biologically, ecologically, medicaly, and/or pharmaceutically-oriented data set. The culmination of your efforts will be a written analysis (worth 65 points) and a 15-minute presentation (worth 35 points) on your findings. </p>
  </introduction>

